Implement dry-run import of effective YAML plus overrides, assigning all views/upstreams to an explicit verified/provisioned owner. Preserve environment substitution, transforms and deletions; keep source backups and checksums. Make import idempotent, define source-of-truth switch, and prevent first-login ownership capture. Acceptance: representative config roundtrip preserves effective behavior; interrupted/repeated import and wrong owner fail safely; reverse path documented. Implementation/local evidence: docs/specs/remote-configuration-acceptance.md. Production and native-host verification remain separate release gates.
